Rename ``collective.recipe.backup`` to ``plone.backup``, and make it work without zc.buildout.
The options are read from the ``[tool.plone-backup]`` table in ``pyproject.toml``,
from ``PLONE_BACKUP_*`` variables in a ``.env`` file, and from environment variables,
instead of from a buildout section.  See the README for migrating.
[jladage]
